gn: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUmOMExzsNt9jfz1aB6OZs1X2o7guky2xVZDaZuekaJ0EsZQaSbFyABzFnzhr7vZrLj_YPZW8S-nx-8xKDxSDQl1l2LlYsVBGU5xr3eqtdB-QhJceKgEJT1jkUHYuf6_RkkubzmdJHt3b1lLkQbXTdcM2jsfKy1Z-y1TFFRo6EApVg_TSRebFbhp8XZA/s4300/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1337%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8142_43%E9%A0%81.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"4300\" height=\"452\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUmOMExzsNt9jfz1aB6OZs1X2o7guky2xVZDaZuekaJ0EsZQaSbFyABzFnzhr7vZrLj_YPZW8S-nx-8xKDxSDQl1l2LlYsVBGU5xr3eqtdB-QhJceKgEJT1jkUHYuf6_RkkubzmdJHt3b1lLkQbXTdcM2jsfKy1Z-y1TFFRo6EApVg_TSRebFbhp8XZA/w640-h452/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1337%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8142_43%E9%A0%81.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><b>#2021阿却賞tio̍h獎作品——台語短篇小說&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">專欄，</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\">本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap傳統白話字。</b></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"backgroun